      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Pet Sematary</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Donâ€™t miss the classic tale from King of Horror and #1 &lt;em&gt;New York Times&lt;/em&gt; bestselling author Stephen King, described by &lt;em&gt;Publishers Weekly&lt;/em&gt; as â€œthe most frightening novel Stephen King has ever written.â€  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;When the Creeds move into a beautiful old house in rural Maine, it all seems too good to be true: physician father, beautiful wife, charming little daughter, adorable infant sonâ€”and now an idyllic home. As a family, theyâ€™ve got it all...right down to the friendly car.  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;But the nearby woods hide a blood-chilling truthâ€”more terrifying than death itselfâ€”and hideously more powerful.  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Creeds are going to learn that sometimes dead is better.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;**&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Stephen King</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:publisher>
